<title>USA: Disney rumored to be planning $500 mln debt.</title>
<headline>Disney rumored to be planning $500 mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Walt Disney Co is rumored to be planning a $500 million 10-year debt offering near-term, U.S. corporate syndicate sources said Wednesday.</p>
<p>JP Morgan Securities was rumored to be the lead underwriter on the deal.</p>
<p>JP Morgan would neither confirm nor deny the rumor.</p>
<p>--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675</p>
